# Runtime state: Kernel v1 only opens an explicitly supplied path.
# 锚定到仓库根目录，避免吞掉同名源码/测试目录（如 agent/memory、tests/memory）。
/agent_log.jsonl
/agent_log.archived-*.jsonl
/session_snapshots/
/sessions/
/runs/
/state.json
/workspace/
/memory/
/skills/

# Coding Agent / local developer aids (not product capabilities)
.ua/
graphify-out/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.codex/
.opencode/
pytest.ini

# OS / UI residue
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.tui_audit_log*
